      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa kaYeremia khuBarukhu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elia Yeremia omunabii yasunjila Barukhu waNeria olwa yahandiika amakhuwa kano mushitabu nikarula mumunwa kwaYeremia, mumuyika kwakhane kwaYehoyakimu waYosia, omuruchi waYuda, ndielino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, akhusunjila iwe, Barukhu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Waboola ori Woowe! Okhuba khukhusaalila khwanje OMWAMI yameeteelekhwo eshibeela! Enjoonyile nokhubinda khwanje, kata shinyoola obuhuluushi bwosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka olamusunjila; mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola, mbu Lola, eshia ndoombakha ndalalikulula, ne eshia ndaraaka ndalasiula; ndalakhola endio mushialo shiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikhaabila omwene amakhuwa amakhongo noho? Orakakhaaba ta; okhuba lola, ndalakhupia abandu bosi khushibii, OMWAMI aboola. Nebutswa obulamubwo ndalakhuheelesia bube eshiyaayo, buli hosi aha olatsiitsanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
